{"id":"5aa17e379c0e3bc4","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra.md","title":"Theorem — Subobject Heyting Algebra","display":"Theorem — Subobject Heyting Algebra","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra","aliases":["14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra"],"display":"Theorem — Subobject Heyting Algebra","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Subobject Heyting Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91189e210bff4156\" href=\"?note=91189e210bff4156\" title=\"14-df-heyting-algebra\">14-df-heyting-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>。子对象序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)=(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X),\\leq_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X,\\bot_X,\\top_X)\">\\(\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)=(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X),\\leq_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X,\\bot_X,\\top_X)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a> 的结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))\">\\(\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))\\)</span> 在本书表示该已绑定全结构满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"91189e210bff4156\" href=\"?note=91189e210bff4156\" title=\"14-df-heyting-algebra\">14-df-heyting-algebra</a>；后文省略运算下标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：IV.8 Theorem 1 (External)，印刷页 201；DjVu 第 106 图页。顺序是单态射因子分解；交是拉回；并是余积箭头的像；蕴涵由分类子中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\">\\(\\wedge\\)</span> 与第一投影的等化子分类后拉回。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a> 核对它们的普遍性质，故全结构满足 Heyting 代数公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"91189e210bff4156","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。子对象序见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]；$\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)=(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X),\\leq_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X,\\bot_X,\\top_X)$ 是 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]] 的结构。$\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))$ 在本书表示该已绑定全结构满足 [[14-df-heyting-algebra]]；后文省略运算下标。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。子对象序见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]；$\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)=(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X),\\leq_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X,\\bot_X,\\top_X)$ 是 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]] 的结构。$\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))$ 在本书表示该已绑定全结构满足 [[14-df-heyting-algebra]]；后文省略运算下标。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"91189e210bff4156","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。子对象序见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]；$\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)=(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X),\\leq_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X,\\bot_X,\\top_X)$ 是 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]] 的结构。$\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))$ 在本书表示该已绑定全结构满足 [[14-df-heyting-algebra]]；后文省略运算下标。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书定位：IV.8 Theorem 1 (External)，印刷页 201；DjVu 第 106 图页。顺序是单态射因子分解；交是拉回；并是余积箭头的像；蕴涵由分类子中 $\\wedge$ 与第一投影的等化子分类后拉回。[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]] 核对它们的普遍性质，故全结构满足 Heyting 代数公理。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)=(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X),\\leq_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X,\\bot_X,\\top_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\wedge","display":false}],"bytes":1507,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra|Theorem — Subobject Heyting Algebra]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]]"},{"id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))$ (subobject Heyting algebra, see [[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]])"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra|Theorem — Subobject Heyting Algebra]]"},{"id":"a62d3691c564e069","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。在其成立的分支，对每个 $X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，采用 [[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]] 的 $\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$；$\\wedge,\\leq$ 分别缩写该结构的 $\\wedge_X,\\leq_X$，$\\mathrm{Neg}_X$ 见 [[14-df-heyting-negation]]。"},{"id":"b2b82e142840e429","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f255d6c7945bca41","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","91189e210bff4156","b51ff4f43221971d","1289398555ba3eed"]}